  "comment": "In-house LED bar rig. The eight physical bars mirror one 7-channel DMX slice, so they are modelled as one fixture with an 8x40 emitter matrix - which is also the geometry of the animation GIFs the `animation` channel selects (8 columns, one per bar; 40 rows, one per LED).\nThe templateChannels block below is required by the OFL schema once a matrix is declared (dependentRequired) and is deliberately unused: no mode inserts it. Do not add a mode that does - 8x40 pixel channels would far exceed the controller's 96-channel universe.",
  "physical": {
    "dimensions": [
      50,
      1000,
      60
    ],
    "bulb": {
      "type": "40x RGB LED"
    },
    "matrixPixels": {
      "dimensions": [
        50,
        25,
        60
      ],
      "spacing": [
        440,
        0,
        0
      ]
    }
  },
